#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:3
#: 756956d58d1a46e5a7f41da61e4692f8
msgid "分支合并（Branch Merge）"
msgstr "Branch Merge"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:5
#: 84d0365f8299442c8d6dcbb285d6df0f
msgid "**分类：** 容器"
msgstr "**Category:** Containers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:7
#: 8376bc65f1084cf8bcfabd036503fa79
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:9
#: ae228a5af9024b89ab568f8ad978265f
msgid "让多张卡片读取同一份输入，并把结果合并为一个数据集。适合从同一批结构分别生成表面、空位或扰动结构。"
msgstr ""
"Let multiple cards read the same input and merge their results into one dataset. This"
" is useful for generating surfaces, vacancies, or perturbed structures independently "
"from the same input batch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:11
#: fbe80fe9738442a1ab8c82cdd4055a01
msgid "这里的“分支”表示数据关系，不表示并行计算。启用的子卡按界面顺序运行，但每张子卡都读取原始组输入，不读取上一张子卡的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Here, a branch describes the data relationship rather than parallel execution. "
"Enabled child cards run in interface order, but every child reads the original group "
"input instead of the previous child's output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:13
#: 06b1eeb3d15342408e8bbcfbb1f9ebc1
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "How It Works"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:15
#: 6347269474d24729811699c26f1f071f
msgid "设组输入为数据集 $\\mathcal D$，启用的子卡操作为 $O_1,\\ldots,O_m$。分支合并的结果是"
msgstr "Let the group input be dataset $\\mathcal D$, and let the enabled child-card operations be $O_1,\\ldots,O_m$. Branch Merge returns"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:18
#: 2fa6ca5358d3439ab53811a79426d0af
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{merge}}=\n"
"O_1(\\mathcal D)\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\cdots\\mathbin{\\Vert}O_m(\\mathcal D),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:23
#: 13046cf90a3749d99ac31cac92c5cd89
msgid "其中 $\\Vert$ 表示按子卡顺序拼接。若配置后置过滤卡 $F$，最终输出为 $F(\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{merge}})$。"
msgstr ""
"Here $\\Vert$ denotes concatenation in child-card order. If a post-filter card $F$ is"
" configured, the final output is $F(\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{merge}})$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:26
#: 3916d6874bca4c4997ca5bb8ab3d8c8e
msgid "例如输入 2 个结构，两张子卡分别输出 6 个和 8 个结构，则合并后为 14 个；后置过滤保留 5 个时，卡片会显示“合并 14 → 保留 5”。"
msgstr ""
"For example, if two input structures are processed by child cards that produce 6 and "
"8 structures, the merged result contains 14. If a post-filter retains 5, the card "
"displays `merged 14 → retained 5`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:28
#: 42ea8d731b8040a5a57662af55066e1a
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:30
#: bb776b8fe18b4288af4845d15ce6e587
msgid "以一份弛豫后的 Ni 超胞为输入："
msgstr "Start from a relaxed Ni supercell:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:32
#: 4f54a400270543d6a528cb528a482204
msgid "选中“分支合并”，加入 `Random Slab` 和 `Targeted Vacancy`。"
msgstr "Select `Branch Merge`, then add `Random Slab` and `Targeted Vacancy`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:33
#: c5a50e57298940709c135dac5b94e5a4
msgid "两张子卡分别配置表面和空位参数，并保持启用。"
msgstr ""
"Configure the surface and vacancy parameters in the two child cards and keep both "
"enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:34
#: 50af9a3ad1d946b99a779e3cd18334a1
msgid "如需统一筛选，在后置过滤槽加入一张过滤卡。"
msgstr "To filter the combined results, add one filter card to the post-filter slot."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:35
#: 7163f3fc5c684c0588edfe6427140fbd
msgid "运行后，输出按子卡顺序合并；卡片底部显示合并前后的实际数量。"
msgstr ""
"After the run, outputs are merged in child-card order. The bottom of the card shows "
"the actual counts before and after merging."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:37
#: dbb33a147f144c9894b9c48fee881799
msgid "什么时候用、什么时候不用"
msgstr "When to use a Card Group"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:39
#: 39aa8ec014ca44ce9b0a4fcf1f0a5faf
msgid "子卡彼此独立、结果需要立即合并：使用“分支合并”。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Branch Merge` when child cards are independent and their results should be "
"merged immediately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:40
#: 05d84e2a73f4459f98a9e3dbd680701d
msgid "每条分支还要继续连接多张卡，或暂时保持独立输出：使用“永久分叉”。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Branch Fork` when each branch needs its own downstream card chain or its output "
"must remain separate for now."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:41
#: 8a292d03dd33489c944491c48491086b
msgid "A 的输出要成为 B 的输入：把 A、B 放在工作流中顺序连接。"
msgstr ""
"If the output of A must become the input of B, connect A and B sequentially in the "
"workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:43
#: 9e35235d9e8844f98e301e2cb223b43d
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:45
#: b7125c3889eb42c391ef9bc43836e3b8
msgid "`card_list`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:47
#: bd8d063e758b45a780610a2adec00136
msgid "组内子卡列表，由界面自动维护。界面顺序决定运行和合并顺序，但不构成前后数据依赖。"
msgstr ""
"List of child cards in the group, maintained automatically by the interface. "
"Interface order determines execution and merge order, but it does not create a "
"sequential data dependency."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:49
#: 5b362742a9c7494e85b8bccb721da2f0
msgid "关闭整个组时，输入直接传给下游，子卡的启用状态会保留。组处于启用状态时，至少要启用一张子卡；否则运行会明确失败，不会把输入误当作结果。"
msgstr ""
"When the entire group is disabled, its input passes directly downstream and the "
"enabled states of its child cards are preserved. When the group is enabled, at least "
"one child card must also be enabled. Otherwise, the run fails explicitly rather than "
"treating the input as a generated result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:51
#: daa01b7dceda4eb1ac08a69e2d251d5d
msgid "`filter_card`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:53
#: d7cae6b4b14b4733bae254410e76e124
msgid "可选的后置过滤卡，默认 `null`。它接收完整的合并结果，一个组最多放一张。禁用过滤卡时只合并，不筛选。"
msgstr ""
"Optional post-filter card, default `null`. It receives the complete merged result, "
"and a group can contain at most one. When the filter card is disabled, outputs are "
"merged without filtering."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:55
#: 170638c8ffcb4a1c93057cbe4ba6607a
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:57
#: 46cc440e02834452a28cf98a0f3ef98e
msgid "`Branch Merge(Random Slab, Insert Defect)`：从同一输入生成表面与缺陷结构并合并。"
msgstr ""
"`Branch Merge(Random Slab, Insert Defect)`: Generate surface and defect structures "
"from the same input and merge them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:58
#: e00edd9b3b24466486db0b05fa5998fa
msgid "`Branch Merge(Atomic Perturb, Lattice Perturb) + FPS Filter`：合并两类扰动，再统一补选代表性结构。"
msgstr ""
"`Branch Merge(Atomic Perturb, Lattice Perturb) + FPS Filter`: Merge two perturbation "
"families and then select representative structures from the combined set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:60
#: 7e95a98d38954865b9d5e7967609303e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:62
#: 58e4c490dfab4995b5182c5082cceddc
msgid "**组输出为空。** 先检查是否至少启用一张子卡，再检查各子卡参数。任一子卡失败时，组会清空已经收集的结果并停止后续分支。"
msgstr ""
"**The group output is empty.** First confirm that at least one child card is enabled,"
" then inspect the child-card parameters. If any child card fails, the group clears "
"already collected results and stops the remaining branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:64
#: 5696cc1c8a8f4b35997b81ff59302f79
msgid ""
"**组内过滤卡把结果全筛掉了。** `filter_card` 的过滤阈值可能过严，例如几何阈值不适合当前体系，或 FPS "
"描述符距离阈值导致提前停止。先看过滤卡自己的预览和错误信息，再调整参数。"
msgstr "**The in-group filter removed every result.** The `filter_card` thresholds may be too strict—for example, the geometry limits may not suit this system, or the FPS descriptor-distance threshold may stop selection too early. Inspect the filter card's preview and error message before adjusting its parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:66
#: 40cd853cbf054a2b8447e8cea20fe644
msgid "**后置过滤后为 0。** 过滤执行成功，但当前条件没有保留任何结构。查看过滤卡的预览，再调整阈值。"
msgstr ""
"**The post-filter retained zero structures.** Filtering completed successfully, but "
"no structure satisfied the current conditions. Inspect the filter card's preview and "
"adjust its thresholds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:68
#: 068cfa058d8446fb9ac6f42672422520
msgid "保存字段"
msgstr "Saved Fields"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:70
#: 0fd736d81cf44008ab37a6192b39a971
msgid "`card_list`：按界面顺序保存的子卡配置。"
msgstr "`card_list`: Child-card configurations saved in interface order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:71
#: f0366f60399341378a9a9ee972faf908
msgid "`filter_card`：后置过滤卡配置；未设置时为 `null`。"
msgstr "`filter_card`: Post-filter card configuration, or `null` when none is set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:73
#: cbb1414a30374ff9ada0359ab2408576
msgid "旧工作流中的类名 `CardGroup` 保持可加载，但启用的空组不再直通输入，会提示至少启用一张子卡。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy class name `CardGroup` in existing workflows remains loadable. An enabled "
"empty group no longer passes its input through; it reports that at least one child "
"card must be enabled."

#~ msgid "卡片组（Card Group）"
#~ msgstr "Card Group"

#~ msgid "把共享同一输入的多张卡片装进一个容器里，并行执行后汇总输出。适合\"同一个母相结构既要走表面链又要走缺陷链\"这种分支场景。组内卡片互不依赖、各自独立读取组输入。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Place several independent cards that share one"
#~ " input in a container, run them as "
#~ "parallel branches, and merge their outputs. "
#~ "This is useful when the same parent "
#~ "structure must feed both a surface branch "
#~ "and a defect branch. Every card in the"
#~ " group reads the group input independently."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 把 `Random Slab` 和 `Random Vacancy` 放入同一组，共享输入，并行生成两个分支，统一导出"
