#~ msgstr "One input must feed several independent cards."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "组内的子卡片列表，由界面拖入操作自动维护，不需要你手动编辑。每项是一个完整的卡片配置 dict（含 "
#~ "class、check_state、params 等字段），子卡片共享组输入、各自独立运行。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The interface maintains the child-card list"
#~ " as cards are dragged into the group. "
#~ "Do not edit it manually. Each item is"
#~ " a complete card configuration dictionary "
#~ "containing fields such as class, check_state, "
#~ "and params. Child cards share the group "
#~ "input and run independently."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "dict 或 null，默认 null。选填：在组内末尾挂一张过滤卡（如 `FPS "
