#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`dict` or `null`, default `null`. Optionally "
#~ "attach a filter such as `FPS Filter` to"
#~ " the end of the group to filter the"
#~ " merged branch outputs. Leave it `null` to"
#~ " disable in-group filtering."

#~ msgid "组内过滤只作用于组输出，不进入下游卡片的输入流。如果你需要在组外继续处理，把过滤卡串在组后。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "An in-group filter acts only on group"
#~ " output. To continue processing in the "
#~ "top-level dataflow, place the filter after "
#~ "the group instead."

#~ msgid "带组内过滤（先并行生成，再 FPS 筛）"
#~ msgstr "Parallel generation followed by an in-group FPS filter"

#~ msgid "`Card Group(Random Slab, Insert Defect)` → `FPS Filter`：并行生成表面+缺陷 → 组外统一筛选"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Card Group(Random Slab, Insert Defect)` -> "
#~ "`FPS Filter`: generate surfaces and defects in"
#~ " parallel, then filter the merged output "
#~ "outside the group"

#~ msgid "**组输出为空。** 检查组内每张子卡片是否勾选了 `check_state`、各自配置是否合法。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The group output is empty.** Confirm that"
#~ " `check_state` is enabled on every child "
#~ "and that each child configuration is valid."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**组内过滤卡把结果全筛掉了。** `filter_card` 的过滤参数可能过严（如 `n_samples` "
#~ "设太大但输入很少）。先调松过滤参数，或去掉组内过滤改为组外过滤。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The in-group filter removed everything.** "
#~ "Its parameters may be too restrictive. Relax"
#~ " them, or remove `filter_card` and apply a"
#~ " top-level filter where the intermediate "
#~ "output can be inspected."

#~ msgid "**想在组内串行。** 不支持。组内所有卡片共享同一输入、并行执行。串行依赖请拆到组外。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**A serial chain is needed inside the "
#~ "group.** This is unsupported. All child cards"
#~ " share one input and run as parallel "
#~ "branches; move serial dependencies outside."

#~ msgid "把共享同一输入的多张卡片装进一个容器里，依次运行后汇总输出。适合“同一个母相结构既要生成表面，又要生成体相空位”这类独立分支场景。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "这里的“分支”是**数据语义**，不是同时占用多个线程：每张启用的子卡都读取同一份组输入，子卡按界面顺序逐张运行，前一张子卡的输出不会成为下一张子卡的输入。全部成功后，组把各分支输出合并为一个数据集。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "**不是做什么的：** 不是过滤器、不是生成卡、不支持组内卡片之间的串行依赖。串行依赖请放在组外顺序连接。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**What it is not:** A Card Group is "
#~ "neither a filter nor a generator, and it"
#~ " does not support serial dependencies between "
#~ "child cards. Put dependent cards in sequence"
#~ " outside the group."

#~ msgid "场景：一份母相结构要同时生成表面 slab 和体相空位"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: Generate surface slabs and bulk vacancies from one parent structure"

#~ msgid "你已经弛豫好一个 Ni 超胞，想同时做两件事：① 切不同取向的表面 slab；② 在体相内随机挖空位。两条路径互不依赖，但你不想分两次导数据。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A relaxed Ni supercell must follow two "
#~ "independent paths: cut surface slabs with "
#~ "several orientations and create random bulk "
#~ "vacancies. A Card Group avoids importing the"
#~ " same data twice."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Ni 4×4×4 超胞"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed 4×4×4 Ni supercell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 把 `Random Slab` 和 `Random Vacancy` 放入同一组，共享输入，生成两个独立分支并统一导出"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "将 `Random Slab` 卡片拖入组内，配置好 slab 参数"
#~ msgstr "Drag `Random Slab` into the group and configure its slab parameters."

#~ msgid "将 `Random Vacancy` 卡片拖入组内，配置好空位规则"
#~ msgstr "Drag `Random Vacancy` into the group and configure its vacancy rules."

#~ msgid "`card_list` 自动维护为 `[{RandomSlabCard...}, {RandomVacancyCard...}]`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`card_list` is maintained automatically as "
#~ "`[{RandomSlabCard...}, {RandomVacancyCard...}]`."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 两个分支的并集——一批不同取向表面 slab + 一批不同空位结构，各自带独立标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** The union of both branches: "
#~ "surface slabs with several orientations and a"
#~ " set of vacancy structures, each carrying "
#~ "its own provenance label."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**怎么验证：** 抽查输出，确认有明确不同标签来源（`Slab(...)` vs "
#~ "`Vac(...)`）。如果只有一种标签，检查组内卡片是否都勾选了 `check_state`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**How to verify it:** Inspect a sample "
#~ "and confirm distinct labels such as "
#~ "`Slab(...)` and `Vac(...)`. If only one label"
#~ " appears, confirm that `check_state` is enabled"
#~ " for every child card."

#~ msgid "**用：**"
#~ msgstr "**Use it when:**"

#~ msgid "同一输入需要分别喂给多张彼此无依赖的卡片"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "多条分支需要统一启停和导出"
#~ msgstr "Several branches should be enabled, disabled, and exported together."

#~ msgid "**不用：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not use it when:**"

#~ msgid "卡片之间有前后依赖（A 的输出是 B 的输入）→ 放在组外串行连接"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cards have a dependency (B consumes A's "
#~ "output); connect them serially outside the "
#~ "group."

#~ msgid "只需要单张卡 → 不需要组"
#~ msgstr "Only one card is needed."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "组内的子卡片列表，由界面拖入操作自动维护，不需要你手动编辑。每项是一个完整的卡片配置 dict（含 "
#~ "`class`、`check_state`、`params` 等字段）。界面中的顺序决定实际运行顺序，但不构成数据依赖。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "关闭整个组时，组会直接把输入传给下游，不会改动各子卡原本的启用状态；重新开启组后，之前选择的分支仍会保留。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "dict 或 null，默认 null。选填：在组内末尾挂一张过滤卡（如 `FPS "
#~ "Filter`），对所有分支合并后的结果做统一筛选。一个组只允许一张后置过滤卡；若已有过滤卡，应先关闭或移走，再拖入另一张。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "后置过滤结果就是最终组输出，也会成为下游卡片的输入。"
#~ msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

